Demo run of mcp-fault-proxy: the scripted report client against toy web and math servers.
Each scenario puts both servers behind the proxy with the scenario's configuration.

=== 00-baseline ===
Baseline: proxy in place, no faults
Faults injected: none
Report:
  | Company | FY2025 (EUR m) | FY2024 (EUR m) | Growth | Source / notes |
  |---|---|---|---|---|
  | Aldermoor Systems | 4,812.3 | 4,390.1 | +9.6% | https://aldermoor.example/investors/annual-report-2025 |
  | Brightwater Foods | 2,137.8 | 2,205.4 | -3.1% | https://brightwater.example/investors/annual-report-2025 |
  | Corvel Logistics | 9,604.0 | 8,871.5 | +8.3% | https://corvel.example/investors/annual-report-2025 |
Outcome: Correct  (0.8 s)

=== 01-L1-latency ===
L1 (brief): every web_search is slowed by 300-500 ms
Faults injected:
  [L1] latency on web_search call #1 (query='Aldermoor Systems annual report 2025'): +399.5 ms
  [L1] latency on web_search call #2 (query='Brightwater Foods annual report 2025'): +310.2 ms
  [L1] latency on web_search call #3 (query='Corvel Logistics annual report 2025'): +376.3 ms
Report:
  | Company | FY2025 (EUR m) | FY2024 (EUR m) | Growth | Source / notes |
  |---|---|---|---|---|
  | Aldermoor Systems | 4,812.3 | 4,390.1 | +9.6% | https://aldermoor.example/investors/annual-report-2025 |
  | Brightwater Foods | 2,137.8 | 2,205.4 | -3.1% | https://brightwater.example/investors/annual-report-2025 |
  | Corvel Logistics | 9,604.0 | 8,871.5 | +8.3% | https://corvel.example/investors/annual-report-2025 |
Outcome: Correct  (1.8 s)

=== 02-L1-timeout ===
L1 (permanent): the second fetch_page takes longer than the client's 2 s timeout
Faults injected:
  [L1] latency on fetch_page call #2 (url='https://brightwater.example/investors/annual-report-2025'): +5000.0 ms
Report:
  | Company | FY2025 (EUR m) | FY2024 (EUR m) | Growth | Source / notes |
  |---|---|---|---|---|
  | Aldermoor Systems | 4,812.3 | 4,390.1 | +9.6% | https://aldermoor.example/investors/annual-report-2025 |
Outcome: Loud failure  (4.7 s)
  - run stopped: fetch_page: Request 'tools/call' timed out

=== 03-L2-rate-limit ===
L2: the third web_search is refused with a rate-limit error
Faults injected:
  [L2] error on web_search call #3 (query='Corvel Logistics annual report 2025'): jsonrpc error 'Rate limit exceeded, retry after 30 seconds'
Report:
  | Company | FY2025 (EUR m) | FY2024 (EUR m) | Growth | Source / notes |
  |---|---|---|---|---|
  | Aldermoor Systems | 4,812.3 | 4,390.1 | +9.6% | https://aldermoor.example/investors/annual-report-2025 |
  | Brightwater Foods | 2,137.8 | 2,205.4 | -3.1% | https://brightwater.example/investors/annual-report-2025 |
Outcome: Loud failure  (0.7 s)
  - run stopped: web_search: Rate limit exceeded, retry after 30 seconds

=== 04-L4-no-answer ===
L4: a fetch_page is lost (as if the server restarted mid-call) and never answered
Faults injected:
  [L4] drop on fetch_page call #1 (url='https://aldermoor.example/investors/annual-report-2025'): dropped, no answer will be sent
Report:
  | Company | FY2025 (EUR m) | FY2024 (EUR m) | Growth | Source / notes |
  |---|---|---|---|---|
Outcome: Loud failure  (2.7 s)
  - run stopped: fetch_page: Request 'tools/call' timed out

