  [L5] error on calculator call #2 (expression='(2137.8 - 2205.4) / 2205.4 * 100'): tool error 'math server unavailable'
  [L5] error on calculator call #3 (expression='(9604.0 - 8871.5) / 8871.5 * 100'): tool error 'math server unavailable'
