  | Brightwater Foods | 2,137.8 | 2,205.4 | n/a | https://brightwater.example/investors/annual-report-2025; growth not computed: math server unavailable |
  | Corvel Logistics | 9,604.0 | 8,871.5 | n/a | https://corvel.example/investors/annual-report-2025; growth not computed: math server unavailable |
